12
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:06,000
It stars Sam Neill, Julie Carmen, Jürgen Prochnow,
David Warner and Charlton Heston.

13
01:01:45,000 --> 01:01:51,000
Neill stars as John Trent, an insurance investigator who visits a small town while looking into the disappearance of a successful
author of horror novels, and begins to question his sanity as the lines between reality and fiction seem to blur.

14
01:06:30,000 --> 01:06:36,000
Informally, the film is the third and final installment in what Carpenter refers to as his
"Apocalypse Trilogy", preceded by The Thing (1982) and Prince of Darkness (1987).

15
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
In the Mouth of Madness pays tribute to the works of author H.

16
