Lovecraft in its exploration of insanity, and its title is derived
from the Lovecraft novella At the Mountains of Madness.

17
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
Distributed by New Line Cinema, In the Mouth of Madness received mixed
reviews upon release, but has gained a cult following.

18
